On 5/30/08, Vid Sintef <picos.picos@gmail.com> wrote:
> ¿Is it really too late to fix these gismu:

Yes.

> cusku (--> cuska)

{cusku} is one of the most used gismu, perhaps even the most
used one. I'd say it would be impossible to change it at this stage.

> cadzu (--> cazdu)
>
> jorne (--> jirne)

{jirne} would conflict with {jirna}.

> spofu (--> spotu)
>
> and so on.

I don't think there is any chance of changing the form of any gismu by
decree. Eventually some not very used one might change through
usage, but none of these would seem to be in that category.

